<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VIKINGS: Universo dos Guerreiros</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-box: border-box; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #0b0c10; color: #c5a880; }
        header { background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.8), rgba(0,0,0,0.5)), url('https://unsplash.com') center/cover; height: 60vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid #ff4500; }
        h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 4px; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff4500; }
        .subtitle { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #8f9499; margin-top: 10px; }
        .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
        .section-title { text-align: center; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; border-bottom: 2px solid #c5a880; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 5px; }
        .pv-container { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; }
        .video-wrapper { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; background: #000; border: 4px solid #ff4500; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.5); }
        .video-wrapper iframe { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
        .grid-universe { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
        .card { background: #1f2833; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; border-left: 5px solid #ff4500; transition: 0.3s; }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); background: #2f3b4c; }
        .card h3 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .card p { color: #c5a880; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; }
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #050508; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #666; margin-top: 40px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>VIKINGS</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">O Universo dos Guerreiros Supremos</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <!-- SEÇÃO DO TRAILER / PV -->
        <section class="pv-container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Trailer Oficial (PV)</h2>
            <div class="video-wrapper">
                <!-- Substitua o ID 'GEXH3WKK0' pelo link do seu vídeo real -->
                <iframe src="https://youtube.com" title="Vikings PV" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SEÇÃO DO UNIVERSO -->
        <section>
            <center><h2 class="section-title">Explore o Universo</h2></center>
            <div class="grid-universe">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Os Guerreiros</h3>
                    <p>Clãs implacáveis guiados pela honra, fúria e o desejo inabalável de alcançar os salões sagrados de Valhalla.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Mitologia Ativa</h3>
                    <p>Um mundo onde deuses nórdicos observam as batalhas e monstros mitológicos testam a força dos mortais.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Combate Sangrento</h3>
                    <p>Animação de alta fidelidade com batalhas táticas de machado, espada, estratégias navais e invasões épicas.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Vikings Anime Project. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
